      "id": "claim_e210be09210a4523a7511d3e0a7bd7d2",
      "statement": "A defensible roof claim file preserves photographs and video, damaged and undamaged comparisons, material and age evidence, weather and inspection records, estimates and invoices, mitigation records, prior-loss information, and recovery evidence; vendor or expert conclusions remain evidence for independent evaluation rather than coverage decisions.",
      "evidence": [
