      "id": "claim_1c9ebcd9cb6f4a33b3f6d90fb1930fb6",
      "statement": "For HO 23 74 2018-09, ACV applies to roof surfacing at least 15 years old, composition shingle subject to the age classification has a 25% payable percentage with the deductible applied after the payable amount, and labor depreciation is permitted under the stated conditions.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://forms/HO/MS/HO-23-74/2018-09.md#L233-L249",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d7a9dde611c36d4a9976392b644a4bfb8def20a999b7ceb311eaa34d4778985c:"
