      "statement": "For HO 23 74 2025-05, ACV applies at Roof Age 12 years or greater and the composition-shingle provision states a 20% payable percentage before the deductible, while the exclusions state a 30% replacement-cost floor and duplicated malformed provisions repeat a floor; the apparent conflict must be escalated rather than resolved by assumption.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://forms/HO/MS/HO-23-74/2025-05.md#L127-L135",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ab1156f6100bb96bfae525afcd63880af3614b713004a05bdbda60ea101b778a:"
