      "statement": "Roof claim communications must distinguish facts, opinions, coverage, scope, valuation, deductible, and payment; Florida OIR-2023-04 requires written factual and policy explanations for denials or limitations, payment of undisputed benefits when due, and consideration of material supplemental information.",
      "evidence": [
